text: >-
  Charlie Kirk Assassination

  1

  CIA

  CIA is suspected linked to NSCC

  (or UVU Center for National Security Studies)

  UVU

  CENTER FOR NATIONAL

  SECURITY STUDIES

  These 7 appear to have profiles removed. Possibly either

  linked to NSC or UVU. Profiles Removed Sept 28.

  A

  Mark Harlan

  Rusty Needs

  Dr. Elena Vasquez

  Sarah Klein

  C

  Jamal Reid

  T Ramirez

  L Patel

  2

  Israel/DC Google Searches

  Internet researchers said Israel before assassination searched for:

  A?

  Michael Harlan

  Rusty Needs

  Jax Donovan

  Elena Vasquez

  E

  Sarah Klein

  Mark Harlan

  C

  Jamal Reid

  This doesn't mean these people did the assassination. But the linkage between
  these is

  interesting with [A] & [B] is interesting

  3

  Charlie Kirk

  Sept 10th, 2025. Assassinated 12:23 MT

  These 4 may have NO

  connection to each other

  The Flight N1098L is designed to launch military drones.

  Normally flies at 41,000' altitude. Dropped to 203' altitude 116

  knots stall speed @ 9:16am MT 1-mile from UVU.

  Then looped back to 1-mile from UVU and 203' altitude @ stall

  speed 25 minutes after assassination.

  4

  Drone Spy Plane N1098L

  Spy Plane N1098L @ Sept 10th. Designed to drop off/pick up drones.

  AXEL10. HADES Spy program.

  A?

  B?

  One internet researcher said these were on the Sept 10th N1098L Flight

  Michael Harlan - Pilot in Command

  Elena Vasquez - Mission Eng/Observer Avionics Specialize

  J. "Jax" E. Donovan - Second Pilot
